ke in recent years 10 percent of  the annual profit our company generates  in 2020 will be split directly among the  team  regardless of how the team is being  compensated cd projekt red has been  criticized for taking this route  especially since the studio previously  said it would not crunch and was  committing to establishing a healthy  work balance  there's been some confusion on which  game saves will transfer from ps4 to ps5  but now we have clarity on at least one  title  if you play spider-man miles morales on  ps4 those saves will be able to transfer  to ps5  you can also upgrade to the ps5 version  on the standalone game for free  however save data from the regular  spider-man will not transfer  this is because spider-man remastered is  only coming to ps5  as an add-on for miles morales it's  included in the ultimate edition  or you can buy it as a 20 dlc and since  the ultimate edition is only 20  more you won't be spending any extra if  you buy spider-man remastered later  and if you play the remaster you'll  notice that peter parker will look  different  that's because insomniac has a new face  model for the character replacing john  bobniak with ben jordan  this is actually due to the facial  capture of yuri lowenthal who voices  peter parker because  ben jordan's face is a better match  spider-man remastered and miles morales  are both out alongside ps5's launch on  november 12th  and finally just a heads up that  nintendo is revealing the next dlc  fighter for smash ultimate tomorrow at 7  a.m pacific time 10 a.m eastern  who do you hope it will be i'll put my  support behind gino let me know who you  want in the comments below  and that's your save state for wednesday  i'm chasity and you can find me on  twitter at chastity underscore v come  back tomorrow for more news and i'll see  you next time  you
 

